All test submissions failed (8 attempts exhausted). Several proposed grids were invalid due to erroneous row widths/cell count (test width must remain 27, height 16). Earlier attempts also mistakenly spread fills too broadly or extended them beyond panel boundaries. For future recurrence, construct exact output programmatically: identify connected rectangles/panel boundaries, for each in-panel 2 mark its 3x3 neighborhood but only recolor eligible 3 cells of its own rectangle to 1; preserve all else. Verify every row has exactly 27 cells and exactly 16 rows before emitting."
